Package: rapsimng.lupin
Title: Crop-Specific Functions and Parameters for APSIM Next Generation Lupin Model
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Bangyou", "Zheng", email = "zheng.bangyou@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides lupin-specific functions, processes and parameter sets used by
    lupin model in the Agricultural Production Systems sIMulator ('APSIM') Next Generation.
    Includes tools for crop process calculations, parameter management and customisation, 
    enabling users to explore, modify and apply lupin model components.
